ticket-30360

@carltongibson said we should use the approach of having a second setting called `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS` in #13850.

I made an opinionated approach on supplying a new parameter, `read_keys` to `Signer`. It makes sense to me to identify the keys that can only be used for validation (perhaps I should have named it validator_keys). I also kept the same pattern regarding the setters and getters in PasswordResetTokenGenerator.
